&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A culture of growth &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we’re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community, and we’re always finding new ways to help people feel welcomed and included. Here, you’ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.leasingmarkt.de/karriere&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.leasingmarkt.de/karriere&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As (Senior) Site Financial Controller (f/m/d/x) you will be part of the Controlling and FP&amp;amp;A team responsible for Factor EU. Our Team is tasked with safeguarding and owning the financial health of the companies operating in Germany, Belgium, Netherlands, Denmark and Sweden. Specifically, they are focused on everything in and around the P&amp;amp;L. We maintain and drive a by-annual budget cycle, serve as active business partners to the operations teams, and execute an impeccable and audit-proof financial closing round each month end. The team strives for continuous improvement in all financial and operational processes and is expected to proactively move the business forward on its profitable growth trajectory. You are responsible for all things finance at our production site in Verden. The role is broad and demanding and therefore requires excellent fundamentals in operational controlling, management accounting, and financial accounting. This position reports to the Head of Finance of Factor EU. The role can be based out of the site in Verden or Hybrid, based in our offices in Berlin. If hybrid, regular visits at the site are mandatory (~20%).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your area of responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You own the weekly and monthly financial reporting for F_EU warehousing and production operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You own the month end closing cycle for the operations, starting with accruals and finishing with high quality variance analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work with the Finance team and the fulfillment teams at the site to prepare and ensure quality inventory records&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You execute the quarterly and annual business planning for both production sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You execute long-term scenario analyses and forecasting as it relates to site operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You serve as a reliable finance business partner to F_EU finance leadership, the production site leadership, site HR departments and the global production leadership.&amp;nbsp;You challenge, sensitize and support workforce staffing and compensation decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You continuously improve the processes that stand behind all aspects of F_EU operations financial reporting, budgeting and controlling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a university degree in STEM-related fields, Business Administration, Finance or Economics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have gained a minimum 3+ years of experience in a similar operations - finance controlling role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know your way around a P&amp;amp;L and are highly fluent in financial and management accounting topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong financial modeling skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a great interest in operational processes and their impact on financial outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel at business partnering through strong communication, organization, and a hands-on mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to solve problems in a structured and transparent way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are based out of Verden or with an ability to travel regularly via train&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deadlines do not bother you, but rather motivate you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL skills are a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior touchpoints with Adaptive and Oracle are a plus but not required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in English, German is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Internal training opportunities plus a yearly Learning &amp;amp; Development budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food &amp;amp; Lifestyle: &lt;/strong&gt;Discounts on Factor_-boxes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Vacation: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive salary and 30 days of vacation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Well-being: &lt;/strong&gt;Access to well-being initiatives, with discounted fitness offers currently being rolled out&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Future Benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;We’re working on introducing additional perks, including mobility support and a company pension scheme, to give our team even more flexibility and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for a challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply now with your complete application documents, also without a photo and without stating specific personal characteristics such as nationality or gender if you choose to do so. German or English language certificates and documents regarding residence and work permits are welcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to hearing from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a new teammate to join us on the journey of keeping HelloFresh a trusted name - someone with a passion for security and appetite for new challenges. Security Engineers work in a variety of ways to constantly iterate and improve HelloFresh’s security posture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Experienced SOC Analyst at HelloFresh, you’ll bring advanced expertise to our SOC team in Manila. Working in a flat team structure, you’ll act as a Senior Engineer handling escalations from junior analysts, driving complex investigations, and ensuring accurate incident reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be the point of contact for Berlin SOC leadership during major incidents, mentor junior colleagues, and help refine SOC processes. This is a hands-on technical role with strong responsibility, requiring both depth in incident response and leadership qualities to keep the operations effective&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsible &lt;/strong&gt;for maturing logging and monitoring of Cloud, IT and Application workloads through automation and IaC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Filter, ingest and optimize &lt;/strong&gt;security-specific events from large log streams such as App logs, Kubernetes logs, CloudTrail, CloudFlare and ELB logs etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conduct&lt;/strong&gt; threat hunts against file-less malware and APTs by leveraging EDR, OS and network telemetry acquired through specialized open-source tool set like Sysmon, Osquery, RITA and Zeek&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Enhanced Coding:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to use AI coding assistants to write scripts for security automation and data parsing and building detection logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investigation Acceleration:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in using LLMs (e.g., Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini) to quickly summarize high-volume JSON logs, investigate and explain complex code snippets etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop &lt;/strong&gt;advanced correlation and cross-correlation rules beyond what is available out of the box to detect sophisticated attacks and fraud cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate &lt;/strong&gt;security metrics and reporting on incidents and effectiveness of the SOC operation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead&lt;/strong&gt; efficient Incident Detection and Response in AWS cloud and enterprise IT environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift Communication: &lt;/strong&gt;Serve as the shift’s main communicator, updating Berlin SOC leadership and local IT/business stakeholders during active incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Playbook &amp;amp; Process Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Suggest detection rule tuning, SOP refinements, and contribute to the team knowledge base to reduce false positives and improve workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor&lt;/strong&gt; level (L1) SOC team, conduct purple teaming workshops and participate in CTFs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven security monitoring and incident response experience in public cloud environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud SIEM &amp;amp; SOAR platforms, DDoS mitigation and preventing tools and Layer-7 Web-based perimeter security controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent programming (automation) skill with Python / Go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud SIEM &amp;amp; SOAR platforms, DDoS mitigation and preventing tools and Layer-7 Web-based perimeter security controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Enhanced Coding:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to use AI coding assistants to write and debug Python scripts for security automation and data parsing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detection Logic:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in writing detection rules (Sigma, KQL) with the assistance of AI tools to optimize query performance and coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of network intrusion methods, network containment, segregation techniques and technologies such as Sandboxes and Intrusion Detection/Prevention Systems (ID/PS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze disparate log sources on demand and cut noise from the signal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication and reporting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Command over log analysis stacks like ElasticSearch, Splunk/SumoLogic, Graylog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open to working on-call in rotational shifts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meeting response time and incident closure metrics, with thorough documentation and timely stakeholder updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a new teammate to join us on the journey of keeping HelloFresh a trusted name - someone with a passion for security and appetite for new challenges. Security Engineers work in a variety of ways to constantly iterate and improve HelloFresh’s security posture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role aims to improve the HelloFresh Security Logging &amp;amp; Monitoring Program by maturing the tools, processes and playbooks to reduce dwell time (indicators of which would be lowered MTTD&amp;amp;R).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsible&lt;/strong&gt; for SOC monitoring, use-case building, triage and advisory using cloud-native SIEM platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conduct&lt;/strong&gt; initial triage of security events and incidents and document progress throughout the Incident Response Lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate&lt;/strong&gt;, optimize, automate and operate modern security solutions like EDR/EPPs and conventional Firewalls, IDS/IPS, Email Security, VPN, and MDM tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage&lt;/strong&gt; premium and open-source threat intel feeds to regularly sweep environments against rising APT campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prepare&lt;/strong&gt; status reports and follow up with the stakeholders through Jira and Incident Mgmt. Platform to close the remediation loop&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilitate&lt;/strong&gt; efficient Incident Detection and Response in AWS cloud and enterprise IT environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 2 years of experience working in mature SOC environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security monitoring and incident response experience in public cloud environments such as AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud SIEM &amp;amp; SOAR platforms, DDoS mitigation and preventing tools and Layer-7 Web-based perimeter security controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of network intrusion methods, network containment, segregation techniques and technologies such as Sandboxes and Intrusion Detection/Prevention Systems (ID/PS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate EDR, EPP and Device Management solutions as per best security practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decent programming skills to enable data processing, IaC and security automations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication and reporting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with log analysis stacks like ElasticSearch, Splunk/SumoLogic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open to working on-call in rotational shifts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is the world leader in meal-kits and one of Germany&#39;s biggest and fastest growing publicly traded companies. Join the Hellofresh security team to help to maintain the highest security standards within the industry. In this role you will join the Cloud Security Team, which is responsible for providing infrastructure security solutions at scale through automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enhance&lt;/strong&gt; the security posture of HelloFresh’s cloud infrastructure and services, hardening them against abuse and nefarious activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure&lt;/strong&gt; containers, CI/CD pipelines and implement guardrails for the developers aligned with the DevSecOps principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate&lt;/strong&gt; procedures and develop products to improve the Security posture of HelloFresh’s infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design&lt;/strong&gt; and operate scalable processes to provision cloud access and maintain least-privilege&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;and train&lt;/strong&gt; your peers on the best practices in security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remediate &lt;/strong&gt;and validate security issues across cloud infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious mindset, the eagerness to learn and a commitment to staying updated with the latest advancements and best practices in the field of security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work experience in a security domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in one or more programming or scripting languages (e.g. Python, GO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with one of the major cloud provider (AWS, Azure, GCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and as part of cross-functional squads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good problem solving skills and the ability to troubleshoot and solve technical issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Embedded directly within our PPC team, this role drives customer acquisition across key online channels including SEA, Display, App campaigns, and Native Ads. Beyond core performance marketing, you will take full ownership of high-impact, cross-functional initiatives that bridge the Marketing department with broader company-wide teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Performance Marketing Manager, you will play a crucial role in developing and implementing high-impact marketing campaigns across all our international markets, covering various languages and products. From inception to execution, you will be responsible for delivering and scaling performance marketing campaigns to drive growth and maximize conversion rates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That means:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, plan, and execute compelling performance marketing campaigns to increase conversion rates and enhance brand awareness in alignment with our targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive performance marketing channels to effectively support the complete consumer funnel, ensuring efficient CPA within allocated budgets. Still you are always welcome to identify opportunities to scale further, challenging the status quo and budget restrictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI to further automate and optimise campaign management, embracing new opportunities coming up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strategies for existing channels and explore new opportunities for media testing to optimise lead quality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Marketing leaders to oversee media planning, asset development, implementation, measurement, and reporting for Performance Marketing efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidently present campaign strategies, results, and actionable insights to stakeholders at all levels of the business, up to executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What distinguishes this position?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers the opportunity to see the direct impact of your work on the team&#39;s processes and the results we achieve. At Raisin, we value teamwork, enjoyment, and personal development, fostering an open and appreciative feedback culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 to 5+ years experience in performance marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of delivering impactful performance marketing strategies, campaigns, and optimisations, with the ideal candidate having worked in an agency setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven international experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An absolute must is the practical use of AI, specifically building gems or AI agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of the ad platforms and networks, Google (Search, Display, App and Performance Max), Microsoft Advertising (Search, MSAN), Apple Search Ads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of other ad platforms and networks, including Social Ads (e.g. Meta, LinkedIn, Reddit) and Native Ads (e.g. Outbrain).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to derive actionable insights from data and effectively communicate them to diverse stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated strategic thinking, translating quantitative and qualitative data into effective marketing strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of customer segmentation and its application in media planning, buying, and campaign development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, results-oriented environment and manage multiple projects effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organisational skills, attention to detail, and a sense of urgency and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player with the ability to work autonomously and take ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional technical experience with tracking technology (e.g., Google Tag Manager, Adjust or other marketing-related tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Google Looker as a business intelligence platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bieten wir dir:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life-Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Mit unseren flexiblen Arbeitszeiten &amp;amp; Remote Work gestaltest du deinen Alltag so, wie er zu dir passt. Außerdem kannst du Überstunden ausgleichen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation mode on&lt;/strong&gt;: Du erhältst 30 Urlaubstage plus einen flexiblen Tag – zusätzlich sind der 24. und 31.12. frei.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Gesundheitsleistungen, attraktive Altersvorsorge sowie Mental Health Awareness Days stellen deine Gesundheit in den Mittelpunkt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect&lt;/strong&gt;: Entfalte dich mit unseren vielfältigen Weiterbildungen und nutze unsere internen Karriereprogramme für deine Entwicklung im WPP-Netzwerk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job&lt;/strong&gt;: Dich erwarten unvergessliche Events, Mitarbeitendenrabatte und weitere Highlights wie das Job Ticket, Wellhub oder das Job Bike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself&lt;/strong&gt;: Bei uns ist jede:r herzlich willkommen - Vielfalt und Chancengleichheit liegen uns am Herzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bewegst du:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager Strategy &amp;amp; Innovation Video&lt;/strong&gt; (Mensch) bist du Spezialist für Bewegtbild und bewegst dich sicher über nahezu alle digitalen Video-Kanäle hinweg. Als zentrale Ansprechperson ordnest du den Bewegtbildmarkt ein, bewertest Angebote und übersetzt Komplexität in klare nächste Schritte für Teams und Kunden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Markt- &amp;amp; Trendanalyse:&lt;/strong&gt; Entwicklungen im Videomarkt (TV, Streaming, ATV, OLV, Social Video) verfolgst du kontinuierlich und hältst somit unsere Planungen up to date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chancenableitung:&lt;/strong&gt; Aus Marktbewegungen leitest du konkrete Chancen ab und gibst klar formulierte Empfehlungen so aufbereitet weiter, dass Kundenteams direkt damit arbeiten können.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Produkt- &amp;amp; Toolentwicklung:&lt;/strong&gt; Bei der Konzeption und Weiterentwicklung unserer Video-Lösungen und -Tools bringst du Struktur, Praxisnähe und neue Impulse ein.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standards &amp;amp; Playbooks:&lt;/strong&gt; An praxisnahen Playbooks und Standards für integrierte Videoplanung arbeitest du aktiv mit und sorgst für konsistente Qualität in der Anwendung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Projektkoordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Gemeinsam mit deiner Führungskraft koordinierst du Innovationsprojekte und stimmst dich eng mit Planning, Buying, Data/Tech und Kundenberatung ab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wissenstransfer &amp;amp; Auftritt:&lt;/strong&gt; Insights teilst du proaktiv mit internen Teams, unterstützt Trainings und vertrittst WPP Media bei Bedarf in Partnerterminen oder Pitches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das zeichnet dich aus:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video-Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW94813120 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW94813120 BCX0&quot;&gt;Du bringst ein&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW94813120 BCX0&quot;&gt;breites&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW94813120 BCX0&quot;&gt;V&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW94813120 BCX0&quot;&gt;erständnis des Videomarkt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW94813120 BCX0&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW94813120 BCX0&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW94813120 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;mit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW94813120 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;und Interesse daran, dieses kontinuierlich&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW94813120 BCX0&quot;&gt;einzubringen und&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW94813120 BCX0&quot;&gt;zu vertiefen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW94813120 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW94813120 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Berufserfahrung&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW117572460 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW117572460 BCX0&quot;&gt;Mehrjährige Erfahrung im Video-Markt bringst du mit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW117572460 BCX0&quot;&gt;. Gerne&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW117572460 BCX0&quot;&gt;Erfahrung aus Kundenberatung oder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW117572460 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;P&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW117572460 BCX0&quot;&gt;lanung –&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW117572460 BCX0&quot;&gt;d&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW117572460 BCX0&quot;&gt;u weißt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW117572460 BCX0&quot;&gt;, wie man komplexe Themen für unterschiedliche Zielgruppen aufbereitet und Menschen überzeugt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW117572460 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW117572460 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beratungskompetenz:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW116316098 BCX0&quot;&gt;Strukturiertes Denken und die Fähigkeit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW116316098 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW116316098 BCX0&quot;&gt;klare Handlungsempfehlungen abzuleiten sind für dich selbstverständlich&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW116316098 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW116316098 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kommunikationsstärke: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW57055158 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW57055158 BCX0&quot;&gt;Du kannst&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW57055158 BCX0&quot;&gt;komplexe Sachverhalte verständlich machen – für erfahrene&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW57055158 BCX0&quot;&gt;Kolleg:innen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW57055158 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;genauso wie für&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW57055158 BCX0&quot;&gt;Neu-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW57055158 BCX0&quot;&gt;Einsteiger:innen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW57055158 BCX0&quot;&gt; oder Kunden.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intrinsische Neugier:&lt;/strong&gt; Marktentwicklungen werden von dir verfolgt - nicht weil du musst, sondern weil du möchtest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eigeninitiative:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt;Du&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;warte&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt;t nicht darauf, dass Themen zu&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt;d&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt;ir&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;kommen –&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt;d&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt;u&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;geh&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt;t auf sie z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt;u&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt;Dabei arbeitest du gerne&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt;soweit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169912539 BCX0&quot;&gt; selbständig, wie du kannst.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamgeist:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW76385017 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW76385017 BCX0&quot;&gt;Wir leben vom gegenseitigen Support. Wer gerne gemeinsam vorwärtskomm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW76385017 BCX0&quot;&gt;en möchte&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW76385017 BCX0&quot;&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW76385017 BCX0&quot;&gt;ist bei uns richtig.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Darüber hinaus bist du:&lt;strong&gt; #teamorientiert #kommunikativ #zuverlässig&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du diesen Job spannend findest, dann ermutigen wir dich ausdrücklich zur Bewerbung, auch wenn du nicht jede oben gelistete Qualifikation aufweisen kannst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Arbeiten bei WPP Media:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als WPP Media gestalten wir die Zukunft der Medien und investieren dabei konsequent in unsere Mitarbeiter:innen. Jede:r Kolleg:in genießt die Vorteile des globalen Netzwerks von WPP Media und WPP, um sich weiterzuentwickeln&amp;nbsp;und an der Spitze von Marketing und Werbung zu lernen. Vielfalt und Zusammenhalt leben wir durch zahlreiche Employee Resource Groups und regelmäßige interne Events - zum Austausch, zur Inspiration und zum gemeinsamen Feiern unserer Erfolge.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;WPP Media ist ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit fördert. Wir berücksichtigen alle Bewerber:innen für alle Positionen ohne Diskriminierung. Unser Ziel ist eine Kultur des Respekts und der Zugehörigkeit, in der jede:r die gleichen Möglichkeiten hat, sich einzubringen und beruflich zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitte lies unsere &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Datenschutzerklärung&lt;/a&gt; für Deutschland, Österreich und die Schweiz, um weitere Informationen darüber zu erhalten, wie wir die von dir bereitgestellten Daten verarbeiten. #LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lunar Sales:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Celonis Lunar Sales is a fast-track, 2-year development programme designed for ambitious professionals who want to accelerate their career at the intersection of AI, enterprise technology, and strategic sales.&amp;nbsp; If you have experience solving complex problems in a client-facing role, in management or strategy consulting or a leading industry strategy function and you are ready to bring that expertise into enterprise sales, this is your launchpad.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Program immerses you in every stage of the customer sales journey, supported by motivating leaders who will help accelerate your growth beyond expectations. If you&#39;re an innovative thinker who thrives on overcoming challenges, our Top Talent Sales Program will provide strategic significance, arming you with the knowledge and tools to address complex problems, create meaningful change and excel as an Account Executive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast-track your growth in enterprise sales through our exclusive top talent program. You will gain hands-on experience selling AI-driven business transformation, build relationships with industry leaders across Celonis verticals, including Automotive, Manufacturing, Banking, FSI,&amp;nbsp; Life Sciences, Consumer Goods, Retail, Energy and Public Sector and develop the leadership skills needed to drive real change for enterprise customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The program focuses on three key pillars&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Strategic Business Development &amp;amp; Executive Relationship Building&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full ownership of generating your own pipeline through cold outreach, persona identification, and first meetings, driving directly towards concrete KPI and revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with C-suite executives (CEO, CFO, COO, CDO/CIO) to address challenges and align with their strategic objectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Tailored Solutions &amp;amp; Strategic Alignment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Celonis Context Model and AI capabilities to address critical business needs, delivering measurable impact and expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align strategies with clients&#39; long-term business goals to maximize platform adoption and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Leadership &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a highly collaborative, competitive cohort of peers featuring team challenges, a strong performance culture, and continuous shared learning experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate cross-functional teams, including Value Engineers, Service Consultants, Marketing, BDRs, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with a senior Account Executive in a dedicated 1:1 mentorship model to accelerate your professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the strategic and operational business needs of your target accounts and effectively communicate how Celonis and its AI-powered Process Intelligence Platform, will meet those to create real opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for delivering revenue in your allocated account patch by creating new business opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify key stakeholder personas, cultivate strategic relationships, and build an internal network of champions to drive customer success and account expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage cross Line-of-Business at C-level and below within your target organizations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become proficient in driving the sales process, following a structured, staged, programmatic flow through prospect, initial call, qualify, pitch to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Value Engineering or personally conduct comprehensive presentations and demonstrations tailored to specific use cases, including Celonis AI, Process Intelligence Graph and industry-specific solutions, showcasing the value of our platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forge strong partnerships, particularly with leading consulting firms, tech partners, and the Big4.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with your team, which includes business development representatives, value engineers, partner managers, and marketing specialists, to ensure seamless collaboration and success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on AI trends, process automation, and digital transformation to position Celonis as the intelligent backbone of enterprise operations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–3 years of professional experience in a client-facing role, ideally at a top-tier management consultancy, a corporate strategy or transformation function, or a leading enterprise technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong academic background in Business Economics, Engineering, Informatics, or a related field. A graduate degree (Master’s, MBA, etc.) from an accredited institution is preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable business acumen, the ability to quickly understand how companies operate, where inefficiencies lie, and how Process Intelligence and AI can create value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong interest in AI and developing business acumen and learning about business processes and key performance indicators, especially in areas such as Finance or Supply Chain.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity or experience in key industries such as manufacturing, automotive, consumer goods, retail, financial services, telecommunications, or utilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills in English and German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A forward-thinking mindset with the ability to think analytically and independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Affinidi&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;is a technology company dedicated to changing data ownership for good. We empower businesses and individuals with control and ownership of their data, with a comprehensive approach to managing their holistic identity – accounting for all aspects of their digital footprint while ensuring privacy and security. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Affinidi’s technology enables users to benefit from decentralised digital identity solutions. We believe that everyone has the right to own and control their data, and we are committed to creating a trusted digital credentials ecosystem that empowers businesses and individuals to securely exchange data and services across borders and industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Product Manager (Technical) who wants to help define how trust is built into the next generation of AI systems. At Affinidi, we’re building the Trust Fabric product suite to give AI agents verifiable identity, policy guardrails, and real-time observability, so organisations can move from promising proofs of concept to secure, governed production deployments with confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a role for builders. You’ll work side by side with engineering to turn ambitious ideas into real, high-impact products, fast, iteratively, and with strong product judgment. You’ll take on complex, ambiguous challenges that don’t come with a playbook, bring structure to what matters, and help the team move with clarity, speed, and conviction. You’ll also collaborate with deeply engaged teams and senior leaders in an environment that expects high standards, values ownership, and gives you the chance to shape meaningful products from the ground up.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you like combining technical depth, product thinking, and execution, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Shape and deliver solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner closely with engineers to define and refine solutions early, helping move ideas from concept to production in practical, incremental steps while staying close enough to implementation to understand trade-offs and guide decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Drive focused, outcome-oriented delivery:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Balance user needs, market context, and execution speed while focusing on getting working solutions into users’ hands for validation, then iterate based on feedback and measurable outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work through ambiguity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Take ownership of areas where requirements are not fully defined, structure problems into clear, actionable paths forward, and maintain momentum even as direction continues to evolve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own product direction:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Contribute to product strategy and roadmap definition, align short-term priorities with longer-term platform thinking, and make thoughtful trade-offs that support both delivery and scalability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborate across stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work across engineering, design, and go-to-market teams, engage effectively with senior and executive stakeholders, and bring alignment and clarity in environments with diverse perspectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be developer-obsessed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Understand developer workflows and key pain points, and help improve integration, usability, and the overall product experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Core experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You bring 5+ years of experience in Technical Product Management, a strong technical background that lets you engage deeply with engineering topics, hands-on experience working with APIs, systems, and integrations, and a proven track record of delivering products in close collaboration with engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Technical depth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You are comfortable understanding how systems are designed and operate in practice, able to engage in technical discussions, challenge assumptions, and evaluate trade-offs, and willing to go into detail when needed by reviewing flows, investigating issues, or clarifying implementation approaches.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;You take ownership from problem to outcome, are comfortable working with ambiguity and evolving priorities, combine structured thinking with a bias toward action, and can move between big-picture strategy and practical execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; communication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;You communicate effectively across technical and non-technical audiences, are comfortable working with experienced, highly engaged stakeholders, and know how to build alignment and drive decisions forward.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Nice to have&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;It’s a plus if you have had exposure to identity, distributed systems, or similar domains, and experience in fast-paced, product-led environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll get&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A team that values ownership, quality, and speed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Close collaboration between product and engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hybrid working model in Berlin + flexible hours&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Unlimited vacation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A strong environment to learn, build, and have impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe in hiring different and diverse talent and providing a safe space where everyone can share their views without fear, where differences are celebrated, and where no one is left out. Inclusive cultures are the foundation for collaboration and innovation within our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this position, you confirm that you have read and understood &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Affinidi’s Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;, and consent to the collection, use, and disclosure of your personal data for recruitment purposes, as described in the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Affinidi&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;is a technology company dedicated to changing data ownership for good. We empower businesses and individuals with control and ownership of their data, with a comprehensive approach to managing their holistic identity – accounting for all aspects of their digital footprint while ensuring privacy and security. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Affinidi’s technology enables users to benefit from decentralised digital identity solutions. We believe that everyone has the right to own and control their data, and we are committed to creating a trusted digital credentials ecosystem that empowers businesses and individuals to securely exchange data and services across borders and industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Full Stack Engineering Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;with deep expertise in &lt;strong&gt;backend systems (TypeScript, microservices, cloud)&lt;/strong&gt; to lead multiple engineering teams building the &lt;strong&gt;Affinidi Elements &lt;/strong&gt;platform. While you will manage and support teams working across the full stack (backend, frontend, platform infrastructure), your technical depth and demonstrated experience in backend engineering will be crucial in guiding architecture, ensuring quality, and driving technical strategy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role blends &lt;strong&gt;people leadership&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;technical leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: you will grow high-performing fullstack teams, define best practices across the stack, and remain hands-on in critical technical decisions to ensure our systems are secure, scalable, and performant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work culture at &lt;strong&gt;Affinidi&lt;/strong&gt; is shaped by the following tenets:   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are unapologetically customer-focused &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We invest in cultures and teams to enable high performance &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Embraces experimentation and builds fast &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We have the courage to be misunderstood &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We work together to unlock data   &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multiple engineering teams, providing &lt;strong&gt;vision, direction, and coaching&lt;/strong&gt; to managers, staff engineers, and senior ICs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive &lt;strong&gt;engineering execution and on-time delivery&lt;/strong&gt; of secure, performant, and customer-centric systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and contribute to the design and development of &lt;strong&gt;high-scale, high-performance distributed production systems&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, design, and business stakeholders to define and execute the &lt;strong&gt;technology roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and evolve &lt;strong&gt;engineering best practices, delivery processes, and quality standards&lt;/strong&gt; to scale effectively&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and develop engineering leaders, fostering &lt;strong&gt;career growth, leadership depth, and technical excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of &lt;strong&gt;emerging technologies&lt;/strong&gt;, bringing innovative approaches to improve scalability, architecture, and developer experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion &lt;strong&gt;privacy by design&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;security-first principles&lt;/strong&gt;, and high-quality engineering across backend and frontend systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; You will be a great match if you:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading engineering organizations in global, high-growth environments while driving on-time delivery of high-quality systems at scale&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess strong &lt;strong&gt; leadership skills&lt;/strong&gt;: coaching, mentoring, developing leaders, and fostering high-performing, inclusive teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are skilled at balancing &lt;strong&gt;strategic vision&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;practical execution&lt;/strong&gt;, aligning engineering teams with business outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess strong knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript/Node.js&lt;/strong&gt;; &lt;strong&gt;Dart &lt;/strong&gt;experience is preferred; familiarity with C#, Go, or similar is a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with &lt;strong&gt; React/Next.js&lt;/strong&gt; and/or &lt;strong&gt;Flutter&lt;/strong&gt;, demonstrates solid understanding of modern web and/or mobile development practices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate proven success in &lt;strong&gt;designing, deploying, and scaling microservices&lt;/strong&gt; in cloud environments, specifically, Amazon Web Services (AWS)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for &lt;strong&gt;privacy, security, cryptography&lt;/strong&gt;, and resilient system design; experience with &lt;strong&gt;asynchronous cryptography and identity/authentication domains&lt;/strong&gt; is a strong plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are skilled at balancing &lt;strong&gt;technical leadership&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;people leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, growing teams while staying engaged in critical technical decisions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel at &lt;strong&gt;cross-functional collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; with product, design, and security stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in &lt;strong&gt;fast-moving startup environments&lt;/strong&gt;, building autonomous teams that experiment, learn, and deliver at speed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across functions, locations, and time zones&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend expertise in RUST&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in decentralized identity solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building systems with advanced cryptography requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can you expect from us:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited vacation policy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within international environment &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning Budget &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile Allowance &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Allowance &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Urban Sport Membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sounds like you? Apply now!  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe in hiring different and diverse talent and providing a safe space where everyone can share their views without fear, where differences are celebrated, and where no one is left out. Inclusive cultures are the foundation for collaboration and innovation within our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this position, you confirm that you have read and understood &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Affinidi’s Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;, and consent to the collection, use, and disclosure of your personal data for recruitment purposes, as described in the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

